                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi T
                    %mn 1
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} T_1
            corresponds to the map
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
