          %p
            In particular, we have the dendroidal set
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Paths
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
