            of the interval object itself. This is something like the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/little+cubes+operad"} little 1-cubes
            operad as seen by
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
